<span style="font-size:10px;color:#666;line-height:1.35">Unchecked = first quadrant (0 → π/2), the view in the textbook figure.</span>
<button onclick="showPopup('Key insight','The sine curve is not a separate object from the circle — it is the circle point&rsquo;s height plotted against the angle. Every feature of the graph (the rise to 1, the fall back, the dip below zero) is just where the point sits vertically on the unit circle.')">💡 Key insight</button>
