      angle: 0.524, full: false, sweep: false },
    { title: 'Climbing through the special angles',
      narration: 'At x = \u03c0/3 the radius has swung higher: the circle point rises and the tracer on the graph rises with it, always to the same height above the axis.',
      angle: 1.047, full: false, sweep: false },
    { title: 'The peak at \u03c0/2',
